      "role": "user",
      "content": "i honestly dont even know why im typing this. just feel like i'm drowning. been working 80 hour weeks for years to catch up on loans and everything just keeps slipping away. i look at my life and there's just nothing left. no energy, no hope, just this constant heavy feeling that i've failed at everything i was supposed to be. it just feels like a loop that never ends.",
